### Padding ignores text size

Insets ignore `Style.space()` changes to `groupPad`/`groupGap`. At a live 1.5× text size, a model's ovals overhang by 4 px and overlap by 2 px.

**Suggested change:** call `scheduleGroups()` when `groupPad` or `groupGap` changes.

<details><summary>Reproducer (fails at 5c7cccbf; a QML model built from Bar.qml lines; shows the stale inset, while the 4 and 2 px figures come from a fuller model that also grows the widgets)</summary>

# Group padding does not follow a live text-size or spacing-scale change

Reproduces groupPad/groupGap updating with Style.space() while the insets already written onto the slots keep the old values, because no handler reruns updateGroupInsets when the pad or gap changes.

