### Open-panel mark is longer at group ends

The fallback mark length (`Bar.qml:2061`) is `0.55 ×` the padded slot width, so in the manual's example bluetooth and audio get longer marks than network (24 vs 17 px for 30 px widgets).

**Suggested change:** subtract `slot.leadInset + slot.trailInset` in the fallback.

# Open-panel mark is longer on widgets at the ends of a group

Reproduces the open-panel mark fallback length being computed from the padded slot width, so bluetooth and audio at the ends of the manual's example group get a 24px mark while network in the middle (and any ungrouped widget) gets 17px.

